        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(android): localize native app surfaces",
        "body": "Related: #104979\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nAndroid exposed 21 app-language resources while onboarding, settings, chat, sessions, voice, notifications, accessibility, and background runtime surfaces still rendered user-facing literals in English.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis adds deterministic Android resources generated from the checked-in native translation artifacts, routes runtime and retained presentation copy through the selected app locale, and adds exact coverage checks for typed UI models, helper returns, interpolations, XML references, generated-resource parity, and raw Kotlin presentation strings. User content, gateway-provided labels, identifiers, commands, paths, URLs, and retained controller data remain verbatim.\n\nLocale ownership is explicit: Android framework locales are authoritative on API 33+, live AppCompat locales are authoritative on API 31-32, and AppCompat XML is read only for cold startup before a delegate attaches.\n\n## User Impact\n\nAndroid users selecting any of the 21 supported locales receive localized copy across the main app workflows, notifications, and background runtime surfaces. The build rejects new uncovered UI literals, stale generated locale resources, and dead resource references.\n\n## Evidence\n\nFinal reviewed SHA: `4934ccba7867c591cf3701cf07d2f69c15016d51`\n\n- `node --import tsx scripts/native-app-i18n.ts check`: 3,780 entries; 21 exact locale artifacts.\n- `node --import tsx scripts/android-app-i18n.ts check`: 1,370 Android keys across 21 locales.\n- Scanner/tooling coverage: 30 focused tests passed.\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxaxrwdexh43wdnwdp4wg2my`: `./gradlew ktlintCheck testPlayDebugUnitTest lintPlayDebug lintThirdPartyDebug assemblePlayDebug --no-daemon` passed; 1,315 unit tests passed.\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxazph2ttytzvhczm6fbg770`: `pnpm check:changed` passed on the exact final SHA.\n- Two fresh independent reviews found no remaining actionable issues.\n- `git diff --check` passed; merge-tree against current `origin/main` was clean before push.\n\nResidual proof gap: no real-device API 31/33 end-to-end language-switch run; AndroidX source contracts and Robolectric coverage own this boundary.\n",
